This can have it's down side. Be very careful in shops.

I engraved with a wand in a huge general store on DLvl 2, and it
happened to be a wand of secret door detection. Unfortunately, I also
happened to be standing next to a large mimic at the time, masquerading
as a potion. Wands of secret door detection, besides revealing traps and
secret doors, also reveal mimics and other hiding nasties:

          You cannot escape from the large mimic. -more-
	  The large mimic hits. -more-
	  The large mimic hits. -more-
	  You die!

